name pdfrender
category Package
revision 69058
shortdesc Control rendering parameters
relocated 1
longdesc The package provides interfaces for the user to control PDF
longdesc parameters, such as line width or text rendering mode. The
longdesc control operations work in a manner very similar to that of the
longdesc color package.
